{"seq":45,"at":"2026-10-23","kind":"corrected","target":{"type":"article","id":"a1673"},"reason":"The claim that water polo and handball having seven players each was 'no coincidence' because both grew out of the same late-19th-century enthusiasm is unsupported (the games developed separately); the sentence now only states the shared count (EN/DE/RU).","by":"provenance-research","sources":[{"url":"https://waterpolo.ca/content/Water-Polo-Basic-Rules"},{"url":"https://olympics.ie/introduction-to-handball"}],"changes":[{"field":"bodyEn","diff":[["=",500],["-","mirrors"],["+","matches"],["=",1],["-","handball"],["+","handball's"],["=",1],["-","almost"],["+","count"],["=",1],["-","exactly "],["=",26],["-","goalkeeper,"],["+","goalkeeper."],["=",1],["-","which is no coincidence: both games grew out of the same late-nineteenth-century enthusiasm for goal-scoring ball games. "],["=",415]]},{"field":"bodyDe","diff":[["=",464],["-","spiegelt"],["+","kommt"],["=",1],["-","den"],["+","auf"],["=",1],["-","Handball"],["+","dieselbe"],["=",1],["-","fast"],["+","Zahl"],["=",1],["-","genau,"],["+","wie"],["=",1],["-","denn"],["+","der"],["=",1],["-","auch"],["+","Handball:"],["=",1],["+","Auch "],["=",24],["-","Torwart"],["+","Torwart."],["=",1],["-","– was kein Zufall ist: Beide Spiele entstanden aus derselben Begeisterung des späten 19. Jahrhunderts für Torspiele mit Ball. "],["=",411]]},{"field":"bodyRu","diff":[["=",452],["-","Водное"],["+","В"],["=",1],["+","водном "],["=",2],["-","почти"],["+","столько"],["=",1],["-","точно"],["+","же"],["=",1],["-","повторяет"],["+","игроков,"],["=",1],["-","гандбол:"],["+","сколько"],["=",1],["-","здесь"],["+","в"],["=",1],["+","гандболе: "],["=",22],["-","вратарь,"],["+","вратарь."],["=",1],["-","и это не случайно — обе игры выросли из одного и того же увлечения конца XIX века голевыми играми с мячом. "],["=",427]]}],"hash":"bf2d47b93dac","actor":{"kind":"agent","name":"provenance-research"},"run":"provenance-research-2026-10-23","chain":"6